# DhakaScenes Pilot — §1.8: `data/` is git-ignored; work_root and out_root
# default OUTSIDE the repo. A symlink inside the project tree is dereferenced by
# shutil.copytree, `rsync -L`, and a Docker build context.
#
# Rule of thumb for this file (2026-09-02): code, configs, docs, tests and small
# provenance JSON are pushable; datasets, archives, model weights and stage
# outputs never are. GitHub rejects any blob over 100 MB, so a large file that
# slips into ONE commit blocks the push until history is rewritten.

# --- secrets and machine-local state ---------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- substrate and outputs -------------------------------------------------
# The nuScenes blob root lives at /home/mt/Zami/nuscenes (configs/paths.yaml).
# It is 15 GB, it is read-only by convention, and it is NOT redistributable
# under the nuScenes licence (§6 licence note [VERIFY]).
/nuscenes/
data/
work/
out/
probe_out/

# --- datasets and dataset archives -----------------------------------------
# pilot_1601.zip (1.3 GB) and pilot_1632.zip (9.2 GB) sit in the repo root;
# the extracted dataroots live under /home/mt/dhakascenes/data.
/pilot_*.zip
*.zip
*.tgz
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
datasets/
local_yolox_build/datasets/

# --- point clouds, masks and other stage blobs -----------------------------
*.pcd
*.pcd.bin
*.npz
*.npy
*.bin
*.parquet
*.h5
*.hdf5

# --- model weights and checkpoints (large, re-downloadable or re-trainable) -
weights/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.engine
*.gguf
*.torchscript
local_yolox_build/runs/
local_yolox_build/*.pt
local_yolox_build/artifacts/*.pt
local_yolox_build/*.log

# --- media (renders, videos) ------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mkv

# --- caches ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.cache

# --- environment -----------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/

# --- editor ----------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# --- generated dependency graphs -------------------------------------------
graphify-out/

# --- separate clone of github.com/nekosaif/sam31 (own git history) ---------
sam31_example/
